    "Negiloso karaya mar mula gi rachungi miketoe karayano mag mula ka gitiyo gi kiyo mag mon mane tiyo e dho Hemb Romo.",
    "Bang’e negiloso laru. Yo milambo mar laruno borne ne romo fut mia achiel gi piero abich gachiel kendo ne en gi pasia momin molos gi law mayom,",
    "pasiani nolierie sirni piero ariyo gi rachungi piero ariyo mag mula, kod ramaki mag fedha kod rang’aw miriwogo sirnigo.",
    "Koma odok yo nyandwat mar laruno nobed maromo fut mia achiel piero abich gachiel kendo nobed gi sirni piero ariyo gi rachungi piero ariyo mag mula man-gi ramaki kod rang’aw miriwogo kor sirni molos gi fedha.",
    "Kochomo yo podho chieng’ mar laruno lachne ne romo fut piero ochiko gaboro kendo ne en gi pasia mong’aw e sirni apar morwakie rachungi apar kaachiel gi ramaki molos gi fedha kod rang’aw miriwogo sirnigo.",
    "Kochomo yo wuok chieng’ mar laruno bende lachne ne romo fut piero abiriyo gabich.",
    "Pasia ma borgi romo fut piero ariyo gadek ne nitie e bath rangach konchiel ka pasiago ong’aw ewi sirni adek man-gi rachungi adek,",
    "kendo pasia mamoko ma borgi romo fut piero ariyo gadek ne nitie e bath rangach komachielo kong’awgi e sirni adek man-gi rachungi adek.",
    "Pasiago duto molworo laruno molos gi law mayom momin.",
    "Rachungi mag sirnigo nolos gi mula. Ramaki gi rang’aw mag sirnigo nolos gi fedha, kendo nobaw wi sirnigo gi fedha; rang’aw mag sirnigo duto mag laru nolos gi fedha.",
    "Pasia duto mag dhorangach nolos gi law mayom momin marambulu gi maralik kod makwar molos gi jatweng’o molony. Borne ne romo fut piero adek kendo kaka pasia mag laru borne ne romo fut aboro,",
    "gi sirni ang’wen kod rachungi mag mula ang’wen. Ramekigi gi rang’awgi nolos gi fedha.",
    "Loye duto mag Hemb Romo kod loye mag alwora mar laru nolos gi mula.",
    "Magi e kar romb gik moko duto mane otigo kigero Hemb Romo, ma en Hema mar singruok kaka nokwan-gi gi chik mane Musa ogolo ne jo-Lawi kotelnegi gi Ithamar wuod Harun jadolo.",
    "(Bezalel wuod Uri ma wuod Hur ja-dhood Juda noloso gik moko duto kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiko Musa;",
    "ne en gi Oholiab wuod Ahisamak ma ja-dhood Dan ma jatich lwedo kendo jagoro kendo jatwang’ lewni marambulu gi maralik kod marakwaro.)",
    "Kar dhahabu duto mane okel kawuok e misango mifwayo mane otigo e tich duto mar kama ler mar lemo ne romo kilo alufu achiel (1,000) kaluwore gi rapim mar kama ler mar lemo.",
    "Fedha mane oyudi koa kuom oganda duto mane okwan e kweno maduong’ ne romo kilo alufu adek mia ang’wen (3,400) kaluwore gi rapim mar kama ler mar lemo,",
    "fedhago ema nochok kane ng’ato ka ng’ato mane okwan ogolo nus shekel kaluwore gi rapim mar kama ler mar lemo nimar kar romb joma nokwan machwo mahikgi oromo piero ariyo kadhi nyime ne gin ji alufu mia auchiel gadek mia abich gi piero abich (603,550).",
    "Fedha maromo kilo alufu adek mia ang’wen-go (3,400) notigo kuom loso rachungi mag kama ler mar lemo kod mag pasia, ka rachungi ka rachungi kawo kilo piero adek gang’wen (34,000).",
    "To kilo piero ariyo negitiyogo kuom loso ramaki mag sirni kendo bawo wi sirnigo kod loso rang’epegi.",
    "Mula mane oyudi e misango mifwayo ne romo kilo alufu ariyo mia ang’wen (2,400).",
