    "gi rachungi mar taya molos gi dhahabu maler gi gigene duto marambulu kaka techene gi mo milielgo;",
    "gi kendo mar misango mochwe gi dhahabu, gi mor pwodhruok, gi ubani mang’we ng’ar gi pasia molier e dhood hema;",
